### 1. 登录并自动保存 token（先跑这一条，后面的都会用到）
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 2. 不带 Token 访问（预期 401）
GET http://localhost:8080/record/list

### 3. 带 Token 查询列表（预期 200 + 数组）
GET http://localhost:8080/record/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 记一笔（注意：不再需要传 userId）
POST http://localhost:8080/record/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "1",
  "category": "餐饮",
  "amount": "38.50",
  "recordDate": "2026-10-29",
  "remark": "午饭"
}

### 5. 月度统计
GET http://localhost:8080/record/summary?month=2026-10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. AI 一句话记账
POST http://localhost:8080/ai/record
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "昨天下午打车26块"
}

### 7. 伪造 Token（预期 401，签名校验不通过）
GET http://localhost:8080/record/list
Authorization: Bearer abc.def
